    "title": "Lord's Acre annual Soup Supper & Auction is this Wednesday, Nov. 5th - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Staff ,\n1 days ago Just a reminder that the Stockton Methodist Church of Restoration’s Lord’s Acre Annual Soup Supper & Auction is this Wednesday, November 5th. The event will be held in the Church’s Fellowship Hall (204 North Elm) from 5:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. There is Dine In, Carry Out, and Delivery (785-425-6562). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
